6-301.11: Each HANDWASHING SINK or group of 2 adjacent HANDWASHING SINKS shall be provided with a supply of hand cleaning liquid, powder, or bar soap. 

6-301.12: Each HANDWASHING SINK shall be provided with: (A) Individual, disposable towels; 

Hand sink at server station did not have soap and paper towels available. Ensure hand sink used for wait staff is stocked with soap and paper towels at all times. Discussed with PIC, soap and paper towels added.
